### Short AWS recommendation

  Keep Cloudflare for static assets, DNS, WAF, and edge routing. Move backend logic into a containerized AWS service:

  Browser
    → Cloudflare Worker
    → API Gateway or ALB
    → ECS Fargate service
    → OpenAI/Gemini or Amazon Bedrock
    → DynamoDB/Aurora + S3
    → EventBridge/SQS + Athena

  Use ECS Fargate for the repository’s current straightforward API proxy. Use Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Runtime with Strands Agents if the application evolves into a true autonomous agent.

